note as BIZ_diagram_47_education
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  A learning platform for doctors and staff (the "doctor courses" the clients asked for):
  structured courses with modules and lessons, instructors, cohorts and enrollments,
  progress tracking, assessments/quizzes with attempts and grading, completion
  certificates, and accredited Continuing-Medical-Education (CME) credits tied to a
  practitioner's specialties and jurisdiction licensing (module 05). Content is governed
  and versioned; certificates are verifiable. Integrates with scheduling for live sessions
  and payments for paid courses.
end note

