note as DEP_diagram_47_education
  Connects to other modules via:
  directory.tenants, iam.users, profiles.health_practitioner_profiles (instructors,
  learners, cme_credit_records), profiles.practitioner_specialties / jurisdiction_authorizations
  (CME accreditation), common.files (media, certificates), payments.payment_intents (paid
  courses), scheduling.appointment_bookings (live sessions), terminology.catalog_concepts.
end note

note as REC_DERIVED_diagram_47_education
  REC 3.3 — DERIVED
  enrollments.progress_percent and course_cohorts.enrolled_count are DERIVED from
  lesson_progress / enrollments (trigger). certificates.cme_credits_awarded rolls up into
  cme_credit_records per practitioner/period. lesson_progress is append-only.
end note

note as HARDENING_diagram_47_education
  REC 3.4 — HARDENING (enforce at DDL)
  - enrollments: partial UNIQUE(course_id, learner_type_concept_id, learner_ref_id) WHERE status IN ('active','completed').
  - assessment_attempts: UNIQUE(assessment_id, enrollment_id, attempt_number); CHECK attempt_number <= assessments.max_attempts.
  - certificates: UNIQUE(certificate_number), UNIQUE(verification_code).
  - lesson_progress: append-only; index (enrollment_id, lesson_id, recorded_at DESC).
  - (learner_type_concept_id, learner_ref_id) polymorphic -> value_set{patient,practitioner,staff,user} + trigger.
end note

note as VALUE_SETS_diagram_47_education
  VALUE SETS (bind *_concept_id; do not hardcode)
  course_type->vs_course_type{cme,onboarding,certification,workshop,microlearning};
  level->vs_course_level{beginner,intermediate,advanced,expert};
  content_type->vs_lesson_content{video,article,pdf,scorm,quiz,live_session};
  delivery_mode->vs_delivery_mode{self_paced,cohort,live,blended};
  learner_type->vs_learner_type{practitioner,staff,patient,user};
  enrollment_source->vs_enrollment_source{self,assigned,purchased,partner};
  assessment_type->vs_assessment_type{quiz,exam,assignment,survey};
  question_type->vs_question_type{single_choice,multiple_choice,true_false,short_answer,matching};
  role(instructor)->vs_instructor_role{lead,co,guest,assistant};
  accrediting_body->vs_accrediting_body{...jurisdictional CME bodies...};
  status/state->vs_lifecycle_state.
end note


